1
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,717
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:28,717
YAMU!

3
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,800
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,620
Your moves!

5
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:06,570
Yugi!

6
00:01:06,653 --> 00:01:07,483
Come on, Yug.

7
00:01:07,566 --> 00:01:08,940
Why won't he answer us?

8
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,617
I've never seen him like this.

9
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:11,857
He's totally out of it.

10
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:15,646
Well, he did just lose his only
chance to save his grandfather.

11
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,900
Yugi, let us help you.

12
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,892
What is happening to me?

13
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:24,540
Strike now or I swear I'll take you down.

14
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,977
Kaiba, I've never backed away
and I'm not starting now.

15
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:30,820
One minute I'm battling
against Kaiba. Yugi!

16
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:33,712
The next minute I'm battling with myself.

17
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,917
Suddenly there was this
other presence inside of me,

18
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,137
willing to do anything to win the duel.

19
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,717
And it took everything I
had just to hold him back.

20
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,271
But that gave Kaiba the opening he needed.

21
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:49,040
I let Kaiba win the match,
but I had no choice.

22
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:53,637
That other presence might have seriously
hurt Kaiba if I hadn't regained control.

23
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:56,037
And now I'm afraid of
what happens next time.

24
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,977
What happens if I can't control it?

25
00:01:58,060 --> 00:02:00,060
No, I can't take that chance.

26
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,600
And that means I can never duel again.

27
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,697
Oh, we have to do something, Joey.

28
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:06,900
Yeah, all right. I'm going in.

29
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,980
It's okay, Yugi.

30
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,157
You just lost a few star chips, is all.

31
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,500
Here, take mine.

32
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:15,297
I owe you big time for
ever getting me this far.

33
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,210
Take them.

34
00:02:16,293 --> 00:02:17,257
But what about...

35
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:18,170
My sister?

36
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:21,477
Sure, she needs my help, but
Gramps is in danger right now.

37
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,560
We gotta get Yugi into the castle.

38
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:25,480
Please, Yugi.

39
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,700
Come on, pal. What do you say?

40
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:31,317
Let's go kick Pegasus' sorry
butt and get your grandpa back.

41
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,340
Go on, Yug.

42
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:33,973
I want you to have him.

43
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,760
I can never duel again.

44
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,857
Come on, snap out of it.

45
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:41,437
You're really starting to scare me, man.

46
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,877
I'm trying to help you out here.

47
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,117
Pull yourself together.

48
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,880
Take it easy, Joey. Huh.

49
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:47,777
If this is how you treat your friends,

50
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:50,297
I can't wait to see how
you treat your enemies.

51
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:51,210
It's mine.

52
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,510
Huh?

53
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:53,890
What's up?

54
00:02:53,973 --> 00:02:56,557
If you guys have enough star
chips to get into the castle,

55
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,977
why are you hanging out here?

56
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:58,920
It's Yug.

57
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:02,257
He lost his chips to Kaiba, and
now it's like he's lost the will...

58
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,320
to go on.

59
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:06,000
So the little guy finally lost one, huh?

60
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,640
Lucky for you guys I came by.

61
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,380
All right, Pegasus.

62
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:13,640
I played your game and won.

63
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,740
Now I'm coming for you.

64
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,020
Ah, Kaiba boy.

65
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:21,240
Shall we toast him, Croquet? What?

66
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:25,817
A toast to Kaiba and his
stunning upset victory over Yugi.

67
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:27,020
Of course,

68
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:31,317
if he thinks he can just waltz in here
and rescue his poor little brother,

69
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:35,840
then he overestimates his chances
and underestimates my abilities.

70
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:39,777
But he'll see.

71
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:41,840
He'll see soon enough.

72
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:46,220
Okay, now listen up.

73
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,080
Especially you, Yugi.

74
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:51,837
You got beat, but that doesn't
mean it's the end of the world.

75
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:55,017
When I got beat, I thought
it was all over for me, too.

76
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:59,980
But then Yugi stepped in and saved my star
chips, and now I'm returning the favor.

77
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,130
No way!

78
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,670
You said it.

79
00:04:02,753 --> 00:04:05,147
Without those, you can't
win the prize money.

80
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:07,680
I'm being kind, not stupid.

81
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:12,980
Ah, she already has ten chips of her own.

82
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,940
No wonder she's being
so generous. Way off.

83
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:17,780
Now go on, Yugi.

84
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:20,040
You know I owe you, so take them.

85
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:23,760
Earth to Yugi, star chips at 12 o 'clock.

86
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,720
Go ahead and take my star chips, Yugi,

87
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:29,737
and then we can all head
up to the castle together.

88
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,644
What, are my star chips
not good enough for you?

89
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,649
Fine, then I'll keep them.

90
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:38,617
And your friends can wipe your nose
all the way back to the nursery.

91
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:39,530
Grow up.

92
00:04:39,613 --> 00:04:41,237
Sometimes you win, sometimes you lose.

93
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,440
Mai, don't get mad.

94
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,877
You just don't understand.

95
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:44,837
Oh, I understand.

96
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:48,497
Your friend lost one lousy duel, and
now he's too chicken to play again.

97
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:49,580
Isn't that right?

98
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:50,650
How pathetic.

99
00:04:50,733 --> 00:04:53,597
it come on chicken boy duel

100
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:59,117
me for them now i'll duel you

101
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:03,137
that's right i'll duel you
right here right now for yugi

102
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:10,220
you

103
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:17,057
and me right here right now
yugi needs those star chips and

104
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:21,677
i'm going to win him for him
come on be serious an amateur

105
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:25,897
like you wouldn't stand a
chance against me would so hun

106
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:29,217
it's sweet you standing up for
yugi and all but sweet doesn't

107
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:33,037
win duels now i'll ask you
one last time are you sure you

108
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:38,620
want to duel me what do you think
i think yugi's in good hands

109
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:44,120
i sure hope you're right buddy because
everything's riding on this one match

110
00:05:50,260 --> 00:05:52,817
so what do you say Taya you ready

111
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:57,960
totally let's go it's time to duel

112
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:03,017
Yuki's still lost in
his own head well maybe

113
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:05,688
a little duel action
will snap him out of it

114
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:11,100
all right my I'm playing the
petite angel in attack mode

115
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:16,220
What is that?

116
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:19,060
Come on, Taya, that is not funny

117
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:24,640
I play Harpy Lady Attack Mode

118
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:35,840
And I'll lay this, too, face
down Right, um... Attack, huh?

119
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:40,530
Whoa!

120
00:06:40,613 --> 00:06:41,680
Oh, that was close!

121
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:53,697
You know, Taya, if you're trembling
with fear after just the first round,

122
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:55,721
maybe you should quit right here.

123
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,180
No way, Mai!

124
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:01,200
I'm in it to win it! Go! Fairy's gift!

125
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,400
Ugh, another of these cutesy cards.

126
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:09,562
Come on, what are we
having, a duel or a pageant?

127
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:11,880
Hmm. Huh?

128
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:14,090
Wabaku?

129
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,120
Oh, I remember this.

130
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,380
It's a trap card.

131
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:18,660
A powerful one.

132
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,958
If only I can remember what it does.

133
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,980
Think, Taya, think. Hmm.

134
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,717
I just better figure it out
before I really need it.

135
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,630
This, too.

136
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:28,320
Face down.

137
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:30,850
Hmm.

138
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,830
Okay.

139
00:07:32,913 --> 00:07:35,537
A rocky start, but I think
Taya's back on track.

140
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:37,149
I hope you're right, Joey.

141
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,280
Everything is riding on this duel.

142
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,290
Go!

143
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:42,300
Fairy's gift!

144
00:07:42,580 --> 00:07:44,168
Attack with enchanted dust!

145
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,820
What's taking so long?

146
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,717
My fairy's attack power is
higher than that Harpy's.

147
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,506
It should be taking her down.

148
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,859
Something's wrong.

149
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:56,500
But what?

150
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:02,360
Oh, no!

151
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:07,400
Sorry, hon, but I activated my magic card.

152
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:09,717
The Rose Whip, a personal favorite.

153
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:13,080
It gives my harpy 300 extra attack points.

154
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:17,497
More than enough to defend her
from your silly pigskinness.

155
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,600
And take out your fairy as well.

156
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,737
Too late to call off
my fairy's attack now.

157
00:08:30,820 --> 00:08:32,437
I just have to hope for the best.

158
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:35,220
Now, my harpy lady, whiplash attack!

159
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:49,660
How about that?

160
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:51,660
Your fairy turned to dust.

161
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:53,860
Clever move.

162
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,737
Mai tricked Taya into attacking by making

163
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:59,037
her think that her fairy
had the most points.

164
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:02,037
But what Mai didn't reveal
until after Taya attacked was

165
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:05,197
that she had a magic card waiting
to power up her hobby lady.

166
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:07,197
Another mistake like
that and it's all over.

167
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:10,760
If you had any idea what
you're really up against,

168
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,038
Taya, you'd call it quits right now.

169
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:16,027
This isn't going to get
any easier, you know.

170
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,652
Just give up and go back to cheerleading.

171
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:21,420
No, I'm not going to let Yugi down, Mai.

172
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:25,817
Please, if this is the start of
some friendship rant, just save it.

173
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:30,371
I've heard all your lame speeches before,
and from that look on Yugi's face,

174
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,580
I'd say he has, too.

175
00:09:34,540 --> 00:09:35,457
Take that back!

176
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:37,260
Come on, admit it.

177
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:39,401
Everyone sees how scared you are.

178
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:43,937
You're just a little girl who's
accidentally stumbled into the big leagues.

179
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:46,373
But whatever, you'll learn the hard way.

180
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,340
Harpy's feather duster.

181
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,500
My turn, hon.

182
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:55,200
And I'm playing this.

183
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:56,280
Face down.

184
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,800
Face down again?

185
00:09:58,140 --> 00:09:59,846
I hate it when she does that.

186
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:02,313
Makes it hard to know what to play next.

187
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,776
Shining friendships.

188
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:06,160
Hey, that's like all of us.

189
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,880
We're all in this together.

190
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:12,917
Boy, I wish this card was as
strong as our real friendship.

191
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,294
Then it would be able to beat anything.

192
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:20,920
It would have Joey's courage,
Tristan's spirit, and Yugi's heart.

193
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:22,397
You can do it, Taya.

194
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,900
We're with ya. Go, Taya.

195
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:27,220
Yugi, are you with me?

196
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:34,186
Maybe this cart is as
strong as our friendship

197
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:40,060
Well, there's really only one way to find
out Shining friendship in attack mode

198
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:45,340
You kept me waiting all this
time for that little butterball?

199
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:48,460
Fine then, harpy lady, whiplash attack

200
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,640
Not so fast,

201
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:58,240
Mai I placed a trap And I remember now
what it does so I'm activating Wabaku!

202
00:10:58,920 --> 00:10:59,750
Wabaku?

203
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,830
That's right,

204
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:04,577
and Wabaku reduces the attack points
of my opponent's creatures to zero,

205
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:06,836
so my shining friendship is unharmed.

206
00:11:08,940 --> 00:11:11,116
I think I thought they had that move.

207
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:16,217
Yeah, if by teaching you mean getting
schooled every time she beats you with it.

208
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:17,130
Watch it.

209
00:11:17,980 --> 00:11:19,039
You're right, Mai.

210
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,677
Maybe I am scared up here dueling
you for such incredibly high stakes,

211
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:26,760
but this card reminded me of something
that helps me face that fear.

212
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:27,960
My friends.

213
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:30,771
And I know with all of them backing me up,

214
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:33,060
I will win.

215
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:37,760
It's like the card says,
Shining Friendship.

216
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:40,040
No matter how dark things may get,

217
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:44,757
the special bond I share with my friends
will always find a way to shine through.

218
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,020
I may be scared,

219
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:48,797
but that fear won't
keep me from dueling or

220
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:52,120
from helping Yugi or
from winning this duel.

221
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:57,560
Yugi, is any of this stuff getting
through to you? Don't you see?

222
00:11:58,040 --> 00:12:01,497
Taya's putting herself on the line
for you Even though she's frightened,

223
00:12:01,580 --> 00:12:02,780
she still battles on

224
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:05,480
It's quite inspiring, really

225
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:10,180
Nice speech, Taya In
fact, it was so stirring,

226
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:13,500
I almost feel the need to throw up Can it!

227
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:16,260
I've had enough of your insults

228
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:22,440
Hmm, the magician of faith I'm playing
this in defense mode And that's not all.

229
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:27,760
I'm playing the silver bow and arrow
card, which raises my creature 300 points.

230
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,500
Fine with me.

231
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:33,760
It's not like I don't
have magic cards, too.

232
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,310
CyberShield.

233
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:37,949
Tell me what you think
about this makeover.

234
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:46,160
Now, Harpy Lady's attack
will be 500 points stronger.

235
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:48,537
But wait.

236
00:12:48,620 --> 00:12:51,620
I'll also play this de-spell card.

237
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,940
Sorry, Cupid.

238
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:55,040
You've been de-accessorized.

239
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:58,800
Not good.

240
00:12:59,040 --> 00:12:59,900
Hold on, Taya.

241
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,256
This might be rough.

242
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:07,486
And I think I'll attack your face-down
card to demolish any hopes you have left.

243
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:13,050
There.

244
00:13:13,133 --> 00:13:14,020
No more hope.

245
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,140
No more faith.

246
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:16,720
No more chances.

247
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:25,437
Don't you know the rules yet, Taya?

248
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:28,477
Since I flipped your magician
of faith over with my attack,

249
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:31,100
you get a card back
from the graveyard. Oh.

250
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:37,631
I mean, how can you seriously hope to
beat me when you don't know the rules?

251
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:41,777
Look, honey, I'm sure that everyone's really
impressed that you've lasted this long,

252
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:44,684
but all you're doing is
delaying the inevitable.

253
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:46,520
I won't give up.

254
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:50,337
come on what you're doing is
pointless yugi's already given

255
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:53,097
up on himself you're not going
to be able to keep fighting

256
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:56,977
for him he has to fight for
himself he has to stand up to

257
00:13:57,060 --> 00:14:00,437
anyone who dares to get in his
way and whatever's going on in

258
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:04,977
his head teya yugi has to deal
with it on his own what maybe

259
00:14:05,060 --> 00:14:08,837
my's right maybe i have to
fight harder maybe i gave up too

260
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,637
easily what do you do when the
thing you're fighting against

261
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:15,117
is some kind of magical spirit
that can take control of you.

262
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,435
Something that's living inside of you.

263
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:19,080
What do you do then?

264
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,220
Face it, Teya.

265
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,437
Yugi's checked out.

266
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,350
He's given up.

267
00:14:22,433 --> 00:14:25,397
He doesn't care about this match
and he doesn't care about you.

268
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,877
Nothing's worth the humiliation
you're going through.

269
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,790
You're wrong.

270
00:14:28,873 --> 00:14:29,703
My friends are

271
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:31,877
worth it. Always.

272
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:35,137
I don't care how much experience
you have playing duel monsters.

273
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:37,317
I don't care what the odds
are against beating you.

274
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,580
I won't give up.

275
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:41,172
Not on this match and not on Yugi either.

276
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:44,120
I won't give up.

277
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,340
I won't.

278
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,510
Taya.

279
00:14:53,593 --> 00:14:55,640
Don't let these tears fool you, Mai.

280
00:14:56,740 --> 00:14:59,740
I may be crying, but
I've never felt stronger.

281
00:15:00,020 --> 00:15:04,196
So you better get your star chips
ready, because I'm about to beat you.

282
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:10,777
And there's not a thing you
can say or do that'll stop me.

283
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:15,272
You may have a tendency to run at the
mouth, but you've got a lot of spunk.

284
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:16,937
Give me your best shot.

285
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:18,860
This Elf's Light's a good card.

286
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:22,437
It would give me a major power
boost to my Shining Friendship.

287
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:24,500
And I also have a D-Spell card.

288
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:26,524
I can use that to get rid of my

289
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:27,790
Cyber Shield.

290
00:15:27,873 --> 00:15:31,517
Plus, since I recovered my Silver
Bow and Arrow from the Graveyard,

291
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:34,877
I can add its 300-point
power boost to the 400

292
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:37,842
-point boost that I get
from my Elf's Light card.

293
00:15:38,020 --> 00:15:41,540
Then, my Shining Friendship's
attack power will be 2,000.

294
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:43,665
I just hope that'll be enough.

295
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:50,281
First, I'm playing this silver bow and arrow
that I brought back from the graveyard.

296
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:56,980
Next, I'll use Elf's Light
to power him up even further.

297
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:03,640
Now Shining Friendship is
2,000 attack points strong.

298
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,300
That's still not enough.

299
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:08,140
Harpy, attack!

300
00:16:09,180 --> 00:16:10,320
Yes, it is.

301
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:14,480
Or does the magic of Dispel
not apply to you, Mai?

302
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:27,540
Attack, Shining Friendship,
with Silver Lightning Arrow!

303
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,680
Let's go!

304
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:39,052
Bullseye for friendship!

305
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:40,340
What a shot!

306
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:43,577
I think Tay's doing better
against Mai than you did.

307
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:44,620
Well done.

308
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:50,060
I almost forgot.

309
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,249
My Harpy's Feather Duster.

310
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:54,105
This card could win it for me.

311
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,953
Harpy's Feather Duster!

312
00:16:58,700 --> 00:17:00,020
I surrender, Taya.

313
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,965
I don't have the cards to win.

314
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:03,980
Uh, giving up just like that?

315
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,880
Don't rub it in, Taya.

316
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,277
Heartbeat Lady was the best monster I had,

317
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:12,536
and seeing as how you beat her,
there's really no point in me going on.

318
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:14,800
I won! Hey!

319
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:17,040
Way to go, Taya.

320
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,597
You really came through for Yugi.

321
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,510
Whatever.

322
00:17:19,593 --> 00:17:20,888
I didn't need these anyway.

323
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:22,360
Good match.

324
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:25,260
Wait, Mai.

325
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,087
I have to ask you something.

326
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,097
Wasn't the last card...

327
00:17:29,180 --> 00:17:30,010
A throwaway.

328
00:17:30,093 --> 00:17:33,137
It was nothing that Teya wouldn't
have been able to beat anyway, really.

329
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,050
Huh?

330
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:37,564
Some cards just aren't
worth playing, huh, Yugi?

331
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:39,530
Thank you.

332
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:41,680
Yugi? Hmm?

333
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:43,877
I, uh...

334
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,960
I won these star chips for you.

335
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:47,490
I know.

336
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,190
Hmm.

337
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:51,520
Thank you so much. Sure thing.

338
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:54,897
I'll never forget what
you did for me, Teya.

339
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:56,980
You overcame your fears for me.

340
00:17:57,540 --> 00:18:00,137
And you've given me the
courage to deal with mine.

341
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:01,360
I will duel again.

342
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:04,893
And hopefully the consequences
won't be as bad as I fear.

343
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:06,300
So take them already.

344
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,417
You're making me blush.

345
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:08,330
Thanks.

346
00:18:08,413 --> 00:18:09,243
You're the best.

347
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,350
Welcome back.

348
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:12,637
You really had us worried
there for a while, you.

349
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,661
Hey, you losers.

350
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:16,980
Last one to the castle
door is a rotten egg.

351
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:19,800
Huh? Let's go! Yeah!

352
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:21,730
Gangway!

353
00:18:21,813 --> 00:18:23,240
You gangway! Hey, wait up!

354
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:24,817
And Tristan takes the lead.

355
00:18:24,900 --> 00:18:25,780
Not likely.
